### GET All books Happy path
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

###


### GET ONE book Happy path
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

###


### CREATE book Happy path
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id":"4",
  "title": "example_title",
  "author" : "example_author",
  "description" : "example_description"
}

###

### Update book Happy path
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/4
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "example_title_new",
  "author" : "example_author_new",
  "description" : "example_description_new"
}


###


### DELETE book Happy path
DELETE  http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/4
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

###
